# Claude Code: .claude/skills/ is the only committed path (empty for now — it
# holds shared, repo-specific skills when we add them). Everything else under
# .claude/ is per-developer state (settings, hooks, agents, worktrees, spin
# metadata, research captures) and stays local.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills

# Local backend response captures (not committed)
tmp/
.spin/
